WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.777
Module 2 builds directly on this foundation Now that
we can talk about

00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:12.258
data meaning and quality we will design relational
structures that preserve that meaning You

00:00:12.271 --> 00:00:18.139
will define row grain identify entities and
attributes choose keys connect tables through
relationships

00:00:18.337 --> 00:00:23.939
and use constraints to protect important rules The
same habit continues

00:00:24.162 --> 00:00:28.741
define the concept first then choose the technical
representation that supports it
